# Tool history unavailable

<%= if @invalid_cursor? do %>
That continuation names no page any more. Cursors expire after 24 hours. Start again at [<%= line(@name) %> on <%= line(site_name(@site)) %>](<%= site_path(@site) %>/tools/<%= @name %>).
<% else %>
The history of `<%= line(@name) %>` on <%= line(site_name(@site)) %> could not be read just now. Try again in a moment.
<% end %>

<%= trailer() %>
